WEBVTT

00:02.690 --> 00:04.040
<b>THE PITCHER - YOZAKURA-KUN</b>

00:04.040 --> 00:06.040
<b>Hey! Big Sis Futaba!
 What do you think?</b>

00:06.040 --> 00:08.860
<b>Perfect for honing your reflexes,
don't you think?</b>

00:08.860 --> 00:10.190
<b>I give up! I give up!</b>

00:10.630 --> 00:13.910
<b>Shinzo and I used to play with this
all the time.</b>

00:18.670 --> 00:22.310
<b>All right. We'll take a short break,
then move on to the next drill.</b>

00:22.310 --> 00:23.390
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:23.390 --> 00:24.500
<b>Huh?</b>

00:25.100 --> 00:27.150
<b>Mutsumi? What are you looking at?</b>

00:27.150 --> 00:29.150
<b>Oh, good work today.</b>

00:29.150 --> 00:31.420
<b>Hey, you two, check this out!</b>

00:31.660 --> 00:35.930
<b>An album?
Yes. I found it while I was cleaning.</b>

00:35.930 --> 00:37.500
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

00:37.500 --> 00:39.620
<b>Hey, that sure brings back memories.</b>

00:39.620 --> 00:42.620
<b>Isn't everyone so tiny and cute?</b>

00:42.620 --> 00:45.390
<b>Hey, Mutsumi, what's this a picture of?
Huh?</b>

00:45.790 --> 00:51.860
<b>That's the one we all took
when Nanao passed his spy license exam.</b>

00:52.250 --> 00:55.010
<b>All of us went to cheer him on, remember?</b>

00:55.010 --> 00:56.700
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:56.700 --> 00:59.600
<b>Oh, right. It was our tradition
to take a family photo</b>

00:59.600 --> 01:02.220
<b>whenever someone passed this exam,
wasn't it?</b>

01:02.220 --> 01:03.720
<b>CONGRATULATIONS ON PASSING</b>

01:07.600 --> 01:11.090
<b>What's a spy license?</b>

01:12.520 --> 01:13.970
<b>Hmm?</b>

01:21.680 --> 01:28.440
<b>MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY</b>

02:44.450 --> 02:46.330
<b>PLAN 11
YOZAKURA GHOST STORIES / SPY LICENSE</b>

02:46.330 --> 02:48.370
<b>A spy license, you see,</b>

02:48.370 --> 02:52.480
<b>is like a membership card
issued by the Spy Association.</b>

02:52.480 --> 02:54.440
<b>Spy Association?</b>

02:54.440 --> 02:56.760
<b><i>At the turn</i>
<i>of the twentieth century,</i></b>

02:56.760 --> 03:01.390
<b><i>an organization was founded by spies</i>
<i>to foster mutual aid.</i></b>

03:01.390 --> 03:03.430
<b><i>That's the Spy Association.</i></b>

03:03.910 --> 03:07.520
<b>And those who pass the exam
held by the Spy Association every year...</b>

03:07.520 --> 03:08.730
<b>SPY LICENSE EXAMINATION</b>

03:08.730 --> 03:14.380
<b>...thereby becoming members,
are issued this spy license.</b>

03:14.610 --> 03:16.230
<b>Whoa...</b>

03:16.710 --> 03:18.740
<b>Once you've earned this license,</b>

03:18.740 --> 03:22.240
<b>the Association will grant you access
to intel and job referrals,</b>

03:22.240 --> 03:25.050
<b>and you'll be eligible for benefits
such as the spy pension.</b>

03:25.490 --> 03:27.950
<b><i>First,</i>
<i>you'll receive the Bronze rank.</i></b>

03:27.950 --> 03:30.040
<b><i>Then, after passing the promotion tests,</i></b>

03:30.040 --> 03:33.160
<b><i>you'll move up to the Silver rank</i>
<i>and finally the Gold rank.</i></b>

03:33.500 --> 03:35.050
<b>MISSIONS - BENEFITS - PENSION</b>

03:35.050 --> 03:38.530
<b><i>As you rise in rank, your missions</i>
<i>become more advanced and lucrative.</i></b>

03:38.530 --> 03:40.340
<b>I see.</b>

03:41.200 --> 03:43.160
<b>CONGRATULATIONS ON PASSING</b>

03:43.160 --> 03:46.990
<b>I'd like to take it, too.
The license exam.</b>

03:46.990 --> 03:48.390
<b>Of course.</b>

03:48.390 --> 03:51.980
<b>I was thinking it could wait a little,
but if you're motivated enough to--</b>

03:51.980 --> 03:54.860
<b>Oh? You're going to take the license exam?</b>

03:54.860 --> 03:55.960
<b>Uh...</b>

03:56.210 --> 03:58.190
<b>I'm all for you taking it,</b>

03:58.190 --> 04:02.530
<b>but needless to say, everyone in our
family has passed it on their first try.</b>

04:02.530 --> 04:06.490
<b>So if, by any chance, you were to bring
disgrace upon our name, you can bet that--</b>

04:06.490 --> 04:09.080
<b>Yeah, yeah. Here comes the usual
"I'm gonna kill you!"</b>

04:09.080 --> 04:10.990
<b>or "I'm gonna obliterate you!" right?</b>

04:15.660 --> 04:16.810
<b>Huh?</b>

04:16.810 --> 04:19.280
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

04:19.280 --> 04:21.930
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Hey, it's okay. Don't worry about it.</b>

04:21.930 --> 04:23.220
<b>What happened?</b>

04:23.220 --> 04:26.640
<b>Oh, the program I was coding glitched out.</b>

04:26.640 --> 04:28.270
<b>It's all my fault!</b>

04:28.270 --> 04:31.390
<b>I touched the cables by mistake
when I was cleaning.</b>

04:31.390 --> 04:32.580
<b>Huh?</b>

04:41.100 --> 04:44.050
<b><i>How the heck</i>
<i>do you even make it glitch like that?</i></b>

04:44.050 --> 04:45.280
<b>Uh-oh!
Oh, crap!</b>

04:45.280 --> 04:47.010
<b>Huh? What?</b>

04:52.740 --> 04:54.480
<b>Big Sis Futaba?</b>

04:54.910 --> 04:56.960
<b>Oh, no, it happened.</b>

04:56.960 --> 04:58.060
<b>Huh?</b>

04:58.060 --> 05:00.020
<b>I'm scared of ghosts.</b>

05:00.020 --> 05:03.930
<b>See, Big Sis Futaba
can't stand scary things.</b>

05:03.930 --> 05:07.240
<b>Even as strong as she is?
</b>

05:07.240 --> 05:11.520
<b>Zombies and monsters can be taken out
by force, so they don't bother her at all.</b>

05:11.520 --> 05:15.190
<b>But since aiki doesn't work on ghosts
or curses, she says they terrify her.</b>

05:15.190 --> 05:17.060
<b><i>What kind of standards are those?</i></b>

05:17.060 --> 05:21.840
<b>She did totally destroy that haunted house
we took her to way back when.</b>

05:21.840 --> 05:25.050
<b><i> Remember how the staff members</i>
<i>were all screaming?</i></b>

05:25.050 --> 05:30.010
<b>Well, she'll calm down by tomorrow,
so we'll have to watch over her till then.</b>

05:35.410 --> 05:36.640
<b><i>Critical condition.</i></b>

05:36.640 --> 05:38.080
<b>Don't worry!</b>

05:38.080 --> 05:40.060
<b>It's just the wind, Big Sis.</b>

05:40.060 --> 05:41.800
<b>Come to think of it,</b>

05:41.800 --> 05:44.470
<b>lately I've been hearing noises more,
even when no one's around.</b>

05:44.470 --> 05:45.570
<b>Huh?</b>

05:45.570 --> 05:47.680
<b><i>And Goliath has been getting...</i></b>

05:47.680 --> 05:49.700
<b><i>-</i>
<i>-...all worked up over nothing.</i></b>

05:49.700 --> 05:53.270
<b>I bet it's the vengeful spirits of those
with a grudge against the Yozakuras!</b>

05:53.270 --> 05:54.500
<b>Stop!</b>

05:54.500 --> 05:56.660
<b>You're going to rearrange my face!</b>

05:57.310 --> 06:01.980
<b><i>And so, our day</i>
<i>babysitting Big Sis Futaba began.</i></b>

06:01.980 --> 06:04.490
<b>Hey, Mutsumi, want me to take over?</b>

06:04.490 --> 06:06.550
<b>It's fine.</b>

06:06.550 --> 06:08.160
<b>...So that's what's going on.</b>

06:08.160 --> 06:10.660
<b>It's been a really long time, hasn't it?</b>

06:10.660 --> 06:13.370
<b>We all have to take care of her
today, huh?</b>

06:13.370 --> 06:14.660
<b>Oh, yeah!</b>

06:14.660 --> 06:17.080
<b>Kengo, don't even think
about pulling any pranks.</b>

06:17.080 --> 06:19.520
<b>Sure, sure. Roger that!</b>

06:19.520 --> 06:21.880
<b>Hey, come on, let's see it!
You can do it!</b>

06:21.880 --> 06:24.210
<b>You'll be fine, Big Bro Shinzo.
Huh?</b>

06:24.210 --> 06:25.380
<b>Bathroom.</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:26.940
<b>Okay, sure.</b>

06:29.630 --> 06:33.910
<b><i>Every week, we bring you</i>
<i>a selection of the hottest topics.</i></b>

06:33.910 --> 06:36.040
<b><i>Today's special feature is about haunted--</i></b>

06:36.040 --> 06:37.910
<b>
<i>-This dish is perfect for this season!</i></b>

06:37.910 --> 06:40.630
<b>Hey, what a pretty flower garden.</b>

06:40.860 --> 06:42.350
<b>Safe.</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:47.780
<b><i>Man, this is</i>
<i>beyond challenging, huh?</i></b>

06:50.590 --> 06:52.110
<b>Hey! Kengo!</b>

06:53.400 --> 06:55.770
<b>Come on, Big Bro!</b>

06:56.000 --> 06:58.120
<b>Didn't I tell you not to pull that crap?</b>

06:58.120 --> 06:59.770
<b>Ouch! Sorry! My bad!</b>

07:04.710 --> 07:07.210
<b>There's nothing behind you, you know?</b>

07:14.090 --> 07:16.680
<b>Hey, it's all right!</b>

07:17.510 --> 07:20.580
<b>There's no such thing as ghosts!</b>

07:28.020 --> 07:29.780
<b>All right, Big Sis!</b>

07:29.780 --> 07:33.530
<b>Taiyo will be standing guard over us,
so let's sleep in peace!</b>

07:37.060 --> 07:39.210
<b>Is that really the wind?</b>

07:39.210 --> 07:41.330
<b>Only one thing to do, I guess.</b>

07:41.330 --> 07:44.340
<b>I'll read you your favorite book
until you fall asleep!</b>

07:44.340 --> 07:45.900
<b>MOMOTARO WITHOUT HONOR AND HUMANITY</b>

07:45.900 --> 07:47.710
<b>Wh-What is that blunt instrument?</b>

07:47.710 --> 07:49.050
<b>It's Momotaro!</b>

07:49.050 --> 07:51.610
<b>This was read to me
all the time when I was little!</b>

07:51.610 --> 07:53.680
<b>Momotaro? You mean <i>that</i> Momotaro?</b>

07:53.680 --> 07:56.720
<b>Whenever I read this,
I get sleepy right away,</b>

07:56.720 --> 08:00.480
<b>so if I nod off in the middle,
you take over for me, okay, Taiyo?</b>

08:00.480 --> 08:02.140
<b>Sure...</b>

08:02.140 --> 08:03.310
<b>All right!</b>

08:03.310 --> 08:05.770
<b>"Once upon a time,
during the Age of Chaos,</b>

08:05.770 --> 08:08.050
<b><i>when demons and humans</i>
<i>were constantly at war..."</i></b>

08:08.050 --> 08:10.010
<b><i>I've never heard this opening!</i></b>

08:10.010 --> 08:14.030
<b><i>"A baby who was plucked</i>
<i>from the river bright red with blood</i></b>

08:14.030 --> 08:16.610
<b><i>was given the name Momotaro..."</i></b>

08:17.280 --> 08:20.460
<b><i>-</i>
<i>-</i> <i>She... She fell asleep!</i></b>

08:20.460 --> 08:22.460
<b>Oh! M-Mutsumi!</b>

08:22.460 --> 08:24.540
<b>Hey, I'll read it to you!</b>

08:24.540 --> 08:25.960
<b>Let's see...</b>

08:25.960 --> 08:27.050
<b>Found it!</b>

08:27.050 --> 08:28.800
<b>"The old woman,</b>

08:28.800 --> 08:33.090
<b><i>sure that Momotaro would be the one</i>
<i>to send the demons to hell</i></b>

08:33.090 --> 08:39.080
<b><i>and become a savior who would</i>
<i>bring hope to all, vowed to raise him.</i></b>

08:39.120 --> 08:40.500
<b><i>After many encounters,</i></b>

08:40.540 --> 08:41.870
<b><i>farewells,</i></b>

08:42.110 --> 08:44.580
<b><i>and countless raging battles..."</i></b>

08:53.020 --> 08:56.740
<b>"<i>Momotaro killed the demon</i>
<i>who had once been his best friend,</i></b>

08:56.740 --> 08:59.100
<b><i>and wept silently.</i></b>

08:59.530 --> 09:04.060
<b><i>We all have no choice</i>
<i>but to surrender to the flow of life,</i></b>

09:04.060 --> 09:06.080
<b><i>a river of no return.</i></b>

09:06.080 --> 09:07.750
<b><i>Floating and bobbing.</i></b>

09:07.750 --> 09:09.130
<b><i>Floating and bobbing..."</i></b>

09:13.590 --> 09:14.740
<b>Huh?</b>

09:14.740 --> 09:16.340
<b>Oh, wow, this is fun!</b>

09:16.340 --> 09:18.510
<b>Reminds me of when I was little!</b>

09:18.510 --> 09:19.800
<b>Big Sis Futaba!</b>

09:20.260 --> 09:23.850
<b>Sorry about that, letting you see me
in such a pathetic light.</b>

09:23.850 --> 09:25.730
<b>Oh, hey, no, it wasn't so...</b>

09:27.140 --> 09:30.670
<b>That book...
Mom used to read it to me all the time.</b>

09:31.440 --> 09:34.440
<b><i>Back then,</i>
<i>I wasn't afraid of anything.</i></b>

09:35.110 --> 09:36.760
<b><i>But...</i></b>

09:37.530 --> 09:39.720
<b><i>it hit me when my mother passed away.</i></b>

09:40.360 --> 09:42.220
<b><i>That there are things</i>
<i>you just can't handle,</i></b>

09:42.220 --> 09:44.700
<b><i>no matter how strong you are.</i></b>

09:45.310 --> 09:50.730
<b>You can train as hard as you can,
but that impervious force</b>

09:50.730 --> 09:54.690
<b><i>will still mercilessly rob you</i>
<i>of what you hold dear.</i></b>

09:55.250 --> 10:01.140
<b><i>And when I think that one day</i>
<i>I could once again lose the people I love,</i></b>

10:01.140 --> 10:03.260
<b><i>I get so scared that I can't bear it.</i></b>

10:04.640 --> 10:08.730
<b>Seriously, I'm a failure
as the eldest Yozakura daughter.</b>

10:08.730 --> 10:12.960
<b>I'm just sitting here, trembling,
feeling powerless to protect everyone.</b>

10:13.650 --> 10:16.800
<b>Rather than expose
that pathetic side of myself,</b>

10:16.800 --> 10:23.620
<b><i>I'd much rather have you all laugh at me</i>
<i>for being afraid of ghosts.</i></b>

10:24.310 --> 10:26.750
<b>I guess it's because
you're my brother-in-law?</b>

10:26.750 --> 10:29.160
<b>For some reason,
I was able to talk to you about it.</b>

10:29.620 --> 10:32.270
<b>Thanks for listening, Taiyo.</b>

10:32.510 --> 10:34.000
<b>Sure.</b>

10:34.870 --> 10:37.720
<b>I think I know where you're coming from.</b>

10:37.720 --> 10:41.870
<b>That feeling of losing your loved ones
to something you're helpless against.</b>

10:42.380 --> 10:44.180
<b>Oh, right, you would know.</b>

10:44.800 --> 10:45.970
<b>But...</b>

10:47.000 --> 10:48.960
<b>that's exactly why</b>

10:48.960 --> 10:54.170
<b><i>I want to become strong like everyone else</i>
<i>and become a full-fledged Yozakura.</i></b>

10:54.730 --> 10:57.630
<b>And gain even more things to protect.</b>

10:59.980 --> 11:01.490
<b>Taiyo...</b>

11:01.490 --> 11:05.370
<b>Oh, sorry!
Didn't mean to make this about myself...</b>

11:06.860 --> 11:09.210
<b>Thanks for keeping me company.</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:12.650
<b>All right, it's getting late,
so you go off to bed, too.</b>

11:12.650 --> 11:13.980
<b>All right.</b>

11:15.870 --> 11:17.040
<b>Taiyo.</b>

11:18.420 --> 11:20.380
<b>Good luck with the exam!</b>

11:23.210 --> 11:24.390
<b>Thanks!</b>

11:30.560 --> 11:31.900
<b>Seriously...</b>

11:31.900 --> 11:34.690
<b>I've gained another
great little brother, haven't I?</b>

11:42.440 --> 11:43.530
<b>SPY LICENSE EXAM VENUE</b>

11:43.530 --> 11:47.580
<b><i>Spy license exam, subject</i>
<i>number three, "Tag," is now in session.</i></b>

11:53.480 --> 11:55.190
<b>Go!</b>

11:55.190 --> 11:56.760
<b>You can do it, Taiyo!</b>

11:56.760 --> 11:57.900
<b>VICTORY</b>

12:08.800 --> 12:10.370
<b>All right!</b>

12:11.100 --> 12:12.980
<b>That guy's amazing, huh?</b>

12:13.720 --> 12:16.840
<b>The Yozakura rookie
sure lives up to the rumors.</b>

12:17.070 --> 12:19.150
<b>Taiyo Asano.</b>

12:19.150 --> 12:20.400
<b>Huh!</b>

12:30.450 --> 12:31.890
<b>I'm coming back to life.</b>

12:32.130 --> 12:35.670
<b>Make sure you refuel so you can
give it your all this afternoon!</b>

12:35.670 --> 12:37.400
<b>Thanks, Mutsumi.</b>

12:37.960 --> 12:39.880
<b>I'm going to do all I can to pass!</b>

12:39.880 --> 12:42.400
<b><i>Huh! That insolent bastard.</i></b>

12:42.640 --> 12:47.220
<b><i>But who knew that I'd run into the guy</i>
<i>with a price on his head here?</i></b>

12:47.220 --> 12:50.200
<b><i>Sorry, but I'm turning you</i>
<i>into pocket money!</i></b>

12:50.200 --> 12:51.200
<b>Whoops.</b>

12:52.390 --> 12:55.120
<b>Fighting among examinees
is banned, remember?</b>

12:55.120 --> 12:57.810
<b>Hoshifuru! D-Damn you!</b>

13:02.610 --> 13:03.990
<b>Hey...</b>

13:03.990 --> 13:05.240
<b>Thank you for rescuing--</b>

13:05.240 --> 13:08.640
<b>Oh, it's only natural
to protect those you love.</b>

13:09.070 --> 13:11.310
<b>Your skin is beautiful
even when it's sweaty.</b>

13:11.870 --> 13:14.500
<b>I'd love to run my tongue
over it directly.</b>

13:18.770 --> 13:21.090
<b>Look out, Mutsumi! He's a pervert!</b>

13:22.040 --> 13:23.760
<b>You sure are cute.</b>

13:23.760 --> 13:29.470
<b>No need to point your gun at me when
you've already shot me through the heart.</b>

13:29.470 --> 13:32.250
<b>What is this guy saying?
He's terrifying me!</b>

13:32.250 --> 13:33.480
<b>Oh!</b>

13:33.480 --> 13:35.210
<b>What? You know him?</b>

13:35.210 --> 13:37.520
<b>Tsukiyo Hoshifuru.</b>

13:37.520 --> 13:39.400
<b>The number one playboy in the spy world,</b>

13:39.400 --> 13:43.400
<b>known to flirt with anyone
regardless of age or gender.</b>

13:43.400 --> 13:46.680
<b>Thanks for introducing me,
head of the Yozakura family.</b>

13:46.680 --> 13:50.640
<b>Would you mind not seducing my spouse?</b>

13:50.640 --> 13:54.830
<b>The marital system
can't stop my free-spirited love.</b>

13:54.830 --> 13:57.350
<b>What? Another one who's into me?</b>

13:57.790 --> 14:01.800
<b>Taiyo Asano, your perseverance that
can't be foiled by your tragic upbringing,</b>

14:01.800 --> 14:03.840
<b>your steadfast sincerity...</b>

14:03.840 --> 14:06.590
<b>To put it bluntly,
you're exactly what I delight in!</b>

14:06.590 --> 14:08.570
<b>Hey, what are you shooting?</b>

14:08.570 --> 14:10.530
<b>And what's up with that doll?</b>

14:10.530 --> 14:15.270
<b>Oh, this is a doll that I made
out of all the hair and clothing fibers</b>

14:15.270 --> 14:18.110
<b>that I collected
on my pilgrimages to your mission sites.</b>

14:18.110 --> 14:20.750
<b>I wish I'd never asked!</b>

14:20.750 --> 14:23.500
<b><i>We'll be resuming</i>
<i>the exam shortly.</i></b>

14:23.500 --> 14:26.470
<b><i>Examinees, please head to the venue--</i></b>

14:26.940 --> 14:29.740
<b>It was fate
that brought us together here today.</b>

14:29.740 --> 14:30.950
<b>Come on, Taiyo!</b>

14:30.950 --> 14:33.350
<b>Let's make it to the goal together!</b>

14:33.350 --> 14:36.580
<b>H-Hey, hold up!
 Let's hide!</b>

14:36.580 --> 14:38.020
<b>Taiyo!</b>

14:39.580 --> 14:41.130
<b><i>Subject number four</i></b>

14:41.130 --> 14:42.730
<b><i>is "Escape from the Water."</i></b>

14:53.970 --> 14:55.390
<b>Impressive!</b>

14:56.510 --> 14:59.000
<b>You're just as gorgeous
when you're soaked.</b>

15:02.040 --> 15:04.920
<b><i>Subject number five</i>
<i>is "Hidden Demon."</i></b>

15:25.750 --> 15:26.920
<b>I caught you.</b>

15:33.420 --> 15:36.790
<b><i>Subject number six</i>
<i>is "Dismantle the Bomb."</i></b>

15:59.490 --> 16:02.350
<b><i>Subject number seven</i>
<i>is "Written Test."</i></b>

16:04.310 --> 16:09.280
<b>SPY LICENSE EXAM</b>

16:18.050 --> 16:19.600
<b>You can do it!</b>

16:31.820 --> 16:33.410
<b>You're exhausted, aren't you?</b>

16:33.410 --> 16:35.870
<b>Why don't you rest in my arms?</b>

16:35.870 --> 16:37.240
<b>No thanks.</b>

16:38.410 --> 16:41.930
<b><i>Attention, examinees!</i>
<i>We commend you for your hard work!</i></b>

16:42.170 --> 16:46.420
<b><i>This concludes today's spy license exam.</i></b>

16:47.040 --> 16:48.130
<b>All right!</b>

16:48.130 --> 16:50.840
<b><i>Please direct</i>
<i>your attention to the end of the hall.</i></b>

16:50.840 --> 16:51.930
<b>Huh?</b>

16:51.930 --> 16:55.030
<b><i>In honor</i>
<i>of your undeniable competence,</i></b>

16:55.030 --> 16:57.550
<b><i>we will issue your spy licenses.</i></b>

16:57.550 --> 16:59.830
<b><i>Please accept them one by one.</i></b>

16:59.830 --> 17:02.690
<b><i>Please note, in order</i>
<i>to preserve confidentiality,</i></b>

17:02.690 --> 17:05.290
<b><i>this venue will be</i>
<i>disposed of momentarily.</i></b>

17:05.290 --> 17:06.440
<b>Huh?</b>

17:06.920 --> 17:09.610
<b><i>Thank you</i>
<i>for participating</i></b>

17:09.610 --> 17:14.090
<b><i>in the 112th spy license exam today.</i></b>

17:19.360 --> 17:20.220
<b>Damn it!</b>

17:47.170 --> 17:48.650
<b>Whoa...</b>

17:49.460 --> 17:51.460
<b>My bad!</b>

17:52.730 --> 17:54.030
<b>Damn it.</b>

17:55.800 --> 17:59.680
<b>That look of despair
also piques me to no end. But...</b>

18:01.280 --> 18:05.230
<b>the sight of you refusing to give up
is even more beautiful!</b>

18:23.010 --> 18:24.180
<b>It stopped?</b>

18:27.850 --> 18:29.060
<b>Taiyo...</b>

18:29.730 --> 18:30.840
<b>Oh!</b>

18:40.740 --> 18:41.910
<b>Taiyo.</b>

18:44.200 --> 18:46.920
<b>It's about to disintegrate!
Let go of my hand!</b>

18:46.920 --> 18:48.080
<b>No!</b>

18:48.870 --> 18:51.400
<b>If you like me for never giving up...</b>

18:52.330 --> 18:54.360
<b>then shut up and see this through!</b>

18:56.420 --> 18:59.200
<b>I see.</b>

19:00.030 --> 19:00.910
<b>Thermal.</b>

19:01.950 --> 19:03.200
<b>Huh?</b>

19:03.840 --> 19:05.100
<b>Whoa.</b>

19:11.430 --> 19:15.650
<b>Examinee No. 951, Taiyo Asano.</b>

19:15.650 --> 19:17.720
<b>You've passed!
Huh?</b>

19:18.150 --> 19:20.430
<b>Let me introduce myself again.</b>

19:20.430 --> 19:23.910
<b>I'm a Silver-ranked spy,
Tsukiyo Hoshifuru.</b>

19:24.410 --> 19:28.040
<b>I'm a proctor
for the 112th spy license exam.</b>

19:28.490 --> 19:29.710
<b>Proctor?</b>

19:29.710 --> 19:30.790
<b>Right.</b>

19:30.790 --> 19:33.900
<b>To test you in the most important
subject of all, that is.</b>

19:35.150 --> 19:38.630
<b><i>Technical skills and talent are no more</i>
<i>than the basics of being a spy.</i></b>

19:39.110 --> 19:42.110
<b><i>At the Spy Association,</i>
<i>tradition and trust are everything,</i></b>

19:42.110 --> 19:44.640
<b><i>and there is one thing we seek above all.</i></b>

19:45.180 --> 19:46.350
<b>And that is...</b>

19:47.390 --> 19:48.830
<b>humanity.</b>

19:48.830 --> 19:50.270
<b>Huh?</b>

19:52.350 --> 19:55.500
<b>Precisely because the spy world
is rife with intrigue and betrayal,</b>

19:55.500 --> 19:58.610
<b>we look for the kind of humanity
that can command trust...</b>

19:58.610 --> 19:59.700
<b>FAIL</b>

19:59.700 --> 20:01.180
<b>...in those who join our ranks.</b>

20:02.190 --> 20:05.790
<b>In this exam, a proctor was assigned
to each and every examinee.</b>

20:05.790 --> 20:07.740
<b>And that's what we were testing you for.</b>

20:08.950 --> 20:13.060
<b>Of course, for someone like you
who's gained the trust of the Yozakuras,</b>

20:13.500 --> 20:16.130
<b>it was probably unnecessary.</b>

20:16.710 --> 20:19.090
<b>Congratulations on passing, Taiyo.</b>

20:20.550 --> 20:22.030
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

20:23.970 --> 20:26.390
<b>So that crush you said you had on me...</b>

20:26.390 --> 20:29.120
<b>That was just an act
to get closer to me as my proctor--</b>

20:29.360 --> 20:32.860
<b>Oh, no, that was me
expressing my most personal feelings!</b>

20:32.860 --> 20:35.860
<b>Um, what?</b>

20:36.600 --> 20:38.400
<b>Now, then, Taiyo,</b>

20:38.400 --> 20:40.800
<b>give me a celebratory hug!</b>

20:40.800 --> 20:44.220
<b>Please stop!
Hey, come here! Taiyo!</b>

20:44.220 --> 20:47.010
<b>I'm going to take you to the moon
and hold you close!</b>

22:18.250 --> 22:20.900
<b>Big Bro Kyoichiro sure is late.</b>

22:20.900 --> 22:23.720
<b>I'm pretty sure he didn't have
any missions today.</b>

22:23.720 --> 22:24.860
<b>Really, now!</b>

22:24.860 --> 22:26.840
<b>What on earth is he up to?
</b>

22:30.220 --> 22:32.430
<b>Oh, my, that was careless of me.</b>

22:32.430 --> 22:34.660
<b>Big Bro! What's going on?</b>

22:34.660 --> 22:38.620
<b>Well, I was just trying to beef up
the security around the house...</b>

22:39.140 --> 22:43.150
<b>so I'd built all these secret rooms
from which I could watch over Mutsumi.</b>

22:43.150 --> 22:45.950
<b><i>But due to my desire to be</i>
<i>even one millimeter closer to her,</i></b>

22:45.950 --> 22:48.090
<b><i>I seem to have made the walls too thin.</i></b>

22:50.400 --> 22:51.990
<b>Hey, that looks tasty.</b>

22:52.610 --> 22:54.560
<b>You can't eat yet, okay?</b>

22:55.410 --> 22:56.750
<b>Hey!
</b>

22:56.750 --> 23:00.020
<b>You don't get to go before us!
 No fair!</b>

23:01.480 --> 23:02.790
<b>Whoops--</b>

23:03.440 --> 23:09.490
<b>So while you were stalking Mutsumi,
you were having a blast scaring me, huh?</b>

23:15.720 --> 23:18.520
<b>Hey, calm down, Futaba.
Let's talk about this...</b>

23:21.560 --> 23:23.170
<b>Okay, say cheese!</b>

23:23.460 --> 23:26.620
<b>CONGRATULATIONS ON PASSING</b>

23:28.000 --> 23:30.590
<b>PASSED THE BRONZE LICENSE EXAM!</b>

23:30.590 --> 23:33.870
<b>YOZAKURA FAMILY RECORDS</b>

23:36.560 --> 23:42.020
<b>YOZAKURA FAMILY RECORDS</b>

23:42.020 --> 23:47.050
<b>NEXT TIME
PRISON BREAK GRANDPA</b>
